The catalog-price estimate follows the pricing semantics of OpenCode's public
`calculateCost` implementation (packages/core/src/session/usage.ts) and the
public `@opencode/client` types. No OpenCode source code is vendored in this
package; OpenCode is a runtime dependency/peer of the host application.

Runtime dependencies and peer dependencies are distributed under their own
licenses:

- @opencode/plugin, @opencode/client — MIT (OpenCode)
- @opentui/core, @opentui/solid — MIT (opentui contributors)
- solid-js — MIT (Ryan Carniato and contributors)

This package stores no credentials and sends no telemetry. It calls only the
documented OpenCode usage-limits API already used by the host TUI.
